OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust joins Alzheimer's
OL,4,Aprevention drug trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust says it has become the
OL,7,Ffirst in Europe to join a trial
OL,8,Fexamining if a new drug can delay or
OL,9,Fprevent the onset of Alzheimer's.
OL,11,FSurrey and Borders Partnership NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust is offering the drug
OL,13,FTrontinemab to people at high risk of
OL,14,Fdeveloping the disease and is the third
OL,15,Fsite worldwide to do so.
OL,17,FThe clinical trial is recruiting 1,600
OL,18,Fhealthy adults aged 55 to 80
OL,19,Finternationally, with the Surrey and
OL,20,Fnorth east Hampshire trust recruit
OL,21,Fparticipants from anywhere in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
